    interpretiveNotes: [{ note: `Guptavati-adi sapta-tika edition (814-pp PDF, per source-provenance table): Adhyaya 1 at PDF pp.116-215. Mūla of 1.3 at PDF p.131 with its seven glosses at PDF pp.131-132. PDF lineation preserved in devanagari/iast above — no speaker line (narrative continues), one pāda per line, closing Devanagari ३.` }, { note: `Tika order on 1.3 in print: (1) Guptavati p.131 (marker only, no gloss), (2) Chaturdhari p.131, (3) Shantanavi pp.131-132, (4) Nagojibhatti p.132, (5) Jagaccandrachandrika p.132 (marker only), (6) Damshoddhara p.132, (7) Chandraprabha Hindi p.132. Verbatim record with rendering is given in the commentary below.` }],
